OL,3,GNEWSACost of living roadshow highlights
OL,4,Asupport on offer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cost of living roadshow held in a
OL,7,FKent town is the "starting point" and
OL,8,F"first step on the ladder" to resolve
OL,9,Ffinancial problems, a local councillor
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FOrganisations, including those which
OL,13,Fhelp people with health and wellbeing,
OL,14,Fmanaging bills and getting back into
OL,15,Fwork, have been in Sheerness for the
OL,16,FSwale Borough Council event on Thursday
OL,17,Fmorning.
OL,19,FThis event, funded by the Crisis and
OL,20,FResilience Fund which helps households
OL,21,Ffacing financial crisis,
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
